&lt;li&gt;Drive outbound prospecting efforts while managing and converting inbound interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead full sales cycles, from discovery to close, delivering tailored ROI solution based proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a robust pipeline, accurately forecasting sales performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate strong, consultative relationships with multiple stakeholders, including C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, deeply understanding customer needs and aligning them with Mixpanel’s value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Mixpanel at industry events and regional forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of the competitive landscape and effectively position Mixpanel’s differentiation within partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
