&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, with a track record across renewal, expansion, and net new motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to close six- and seven-figure deals with 6–12 month sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable multi-threading into VP and C-suite — you build executive relationships, not just user relationships&lt;/li&gt;
